{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いて下さりありがとうございます🐈‍⬛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 増本綺良です🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "サクラミーツフェス ｰ Keep Changing ｰ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キービジュアルが公開されました✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イベントのキービジュアルが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎回大好きなので完成をずっと楽しみにしてました📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回も青春感満載でめちゃくちゃステキです💐"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237-01.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後に出演させて頂くサクラミーツフェスになるので、私がやりたいことをめちゃくちゃ詰め込んで下さっていますm(_ _)m"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "難しいと思うけど一応言ってみようかな〜という感じの内容まで全て叶えて頂けて、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがたいし、めちゃくちゃ楽しみです🌸"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237-02.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月10日が待ち遠しい😎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先週の公開収録も楽しかったですね！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237-03.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237-04.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モモミちゃんがゲストに来てくれました🍑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここでしか見られない対決です💥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "公開収録の様子は8/20のOAをチェック✅"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/4311a4b0a50ee9490911507012237-05.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気づいたらツアーももう半分です🥲"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/images/14/4a7/431